          "draft:how/title",
          "Know what happened?\nGet paid to report it."
        ],
        [
          "draft:how/lead",
          "Every Augur Lituus answer comes from someone with REP at stake. Report the right outcome first to earn the reward, or challenge a wrong one to win 80% of its bond. A wrong call costs your bond."
        ],
        [
          "draft:how/step-1",
          "A question opens"
        ],
        [
          "draft:how/step-1-text",
          "Anyone can ask a multiple-choice question and pay a fee in REP. The fee funds a reward for reporting the right answer, and the reward grows the longer the question waits."
