          "How does today’s Augur relate to its earlier prediction markets?"
        ],
        [
          "I166:1081;166:559;166:527",
          "Augur launched on Ethereum in 2018 as a decentralized prediction market protocol, with REP holders settling disputed outcomes. Augur v2 still runs today, and in August 2026 its fork mechanism completed its first live run. Augur Lituus, the next generation of Augur’s oracle, is designed to resolve questions for other prediction markets and applications, not only Augur’s own."
